<description>&lt;p&gt;Communal clashes in South Sudan have intensified, with 16 dead and 34 injured in recent fighting and dozens feared missing after an attack on Jonglei’s Miny Island, while 27,000 people are displaced in Upper Nile amid escalating Kitgwang fighting. The UN envoy is urging South Sudanese leaders to choose consensus over confrontation, and the African Union has expressed deep concerns over the renewed clashes, while Uganda has defended its military deployment in the country. A pastor received death threats in a refugee camp and a Juba Dal activist was hacked to death in Cumilla, reflecting targeted violence against civilians. The EU and Germany-funded SGBV prevention project has concluded after four years. Two battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxPV3c5dVRRcDBQSkl3azc5Z2drTTFlMjFCYllTY3ZTY0JST3g0bjlVb2VKYkRzMHdwbkNuZXVDTUJ2ZkNCS1FBeERoMFh5UUo5cFBCdTMyWmVBQlE1Slp5M251SEhjV0hkbk9lMFdrSDFOMWlOY1pnQmFvaEJXaEExaTdmSjhLdVpRblp4YU5paWc0VzA?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxOM0YtNEVQN1RvMDA3R2NJR3JtV2ZvVGpZR3dZWHhEdFpDS29rOTBXU1hhdWp1alVHSFJlcHpYNlhqOElJVTlGT0pwRE9jdndScEp5a1pwUDNmaXcwcnlYVWpxb1VKOFh1VFFpbFoxYnRsa3R5VkhVa1pwV0JDV1NYY0xvUmpCNU1nSWxQYkNMQTdCM2Q4Zm5qSjVmVXE?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUkFVX3lxTFB4SXpQUU5XeFZLSmtvU2NzZWVwNHFXQmhNd3F2T0wzZ1pFZnBhUjNTUm9DMExfOWlTalZKRzBycG5uWUUyTHEwWVNWc0REWnhpRXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Addis Standard&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxNZ0l1NTJiOUtkUkIxSE52U1gzM0syMDBka